      "result": "All 21 checklist items have been executed and recorded — coverage is complete.\n\n**Summary: 16 PASS / 5 FAIL**\n\nThe core resume-building flows work well: creating, editing all content types, template switching, section reorder/visibility, live preview, preview toggle, duplication with proper copy isolation, multi-variation management, and case-insensitive search with date sorting.\n\nFive defects were found:\n\n| ID | Issue |\n|---|---|\n| **FT-19** | Date filtering is entirely missing — no exact-date or date-range control exists on the dashboard (0 date inputs in DOM). |\n| **CS-9** | No date-period validation — end-before-start and future dates are silently accepted and rendered (\"Jan 2030 - May 2019\"). |\n| **CS-11** | No persistence — a reload wipes all created/edited/duplicated/renamed resumes and resurrects deleted ones; storage is empty. |\n| **CS-21** | The dashboard Rename dialog **applies** a whitespace-only title, leaving a blank card name; the editor rename path reverts but gives no feedback at all. |\n| **CT-20** | The customizable Contact heading is never rendered in any style, and the Summary heading is dropped entirely in the Minimal style. |",
